    {
      "name": "villar_fit",
      "doc": "Villar (2019) fit, computed by BOOM on ingestion. Leaves are villar_pso PARAM_NAMES x FILTERS plus reduced_chi2 and peak_flux. A fit that was skipped writes NaN to every leaf rather than omitting them, so the field is always present and a comparison against a skipped fit is false.",
