      "name": "sso_history",
      "doc": "Prior detections of the matched solar-system object, oldest first, within a year and inside the association radius. Each entry carries its own geometry rather than the alert's, so a window statistic gets one value per point. The last five are null on entries enriched before SSO geometry shipped, and fill in as the window rolls forward.",
